title: WhiteWomenEncounter
---
<<declare $wwNumber = 0>>
<<set $wwNumber = random_range(0, 3)>>
<<if $wwNumber == 0>>
Get away from me! #line:GetAway
<<elseif $wwNumber == 1>>
You won’t trick me. I know what you are. #line:YouWont
<<elseif $wwNumber == 2>>
You took him! Give him back! #line:YouTook
<<else>>
Your lies won’t break me. #line:YourLies
<<endif>>
